    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your processor, define your strategy, dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this innovative tycoon game, revolutionize the tech world by developing your very own custom processors! Manage your production line, optimize your hardware architecture, and compete with rival companies to become the market leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to climb to the top of the tech world? Build your own chip empire and leave your mark on processor history! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fddf1a013d072f2ea7177b92b8b93fb6.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide on core count, efficiency, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/6bbd48ba7e2d28ba52e5d3faf07bb800.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new technologies to build more powerful and efficient CPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/301c16603e1b562822ef68bc9ba5c238.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design customized areas for different use scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/e3259df3876229a0615621e72d9cc350.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create microarchitectures at the hardware level and push performance to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/9fef75fa0b9b02c8a432dbcb8063dd43.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small but deep story awaits you. Make deals with mysterious figures, choose your own path \u2014 right or wrong, it's up to you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your processor, define your strategy, dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this innovative tycoon game, revolutionize the tech world by developing your very own custom processors! Manage your production line, optimize your hardware architecture, and compete with rival companies to become the market leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to climb to the top of the tech world? Build your own chip empire and leave your mark on processor history! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fddf1a013d072f2ea7177b92b8b93fb6.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide on core count, efficiency, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/8caf4f8b5ad200efe33c66a8252fc6f4.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/6bbd48ba7e2d28ba52e5d3faf07bb800.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new technologies to build more powerful and efficient CPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/2cb14d8bee0a6829bd03d0648ba3382b.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/301c16603e1b562822ef68bc9ba5c238.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design customized areas for different use scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/0346c86d87450870c4a95cd168eff735.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/e3259df3876229a0615621e72d9cc350.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create microarchitectures at the hardware level and push performance to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.poster.avif?t=1754403173\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.webm?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/fba5d017ada8bd63c2e755778d6e4864.mp4?t=1754403173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/9fef75fa0b9b02c8a432dbcb8063dd43.avif?t=1754403173\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small but deep story awaits you. Make deals with mysterious figures, choose your own path \u2014 right or wrong, it's up to you!</p>",
